  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Pacific Partner Anti-Corruption Commitments through UNODC and Transparency International</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity supports the work of the United Nations Office on Drugs and Crime (UNODC) and Transparency International (TI) in the Pacific. UNODC will support countries to meet their commitments to the Teieniwa Vision and UN Convention against Corruption while TI&apos;s anti-corruption programme is to promote and empower civil society and citizen engagement in reducing corruption.</narrative>
  </description>
